{
  "name": "budget_summary",
  "description": "Plan, actual, remaining and totals for one month and currency: actual is net spending from ordinary records in that currency, refunds included; transfers, corrections, other months and other currencies are not counted; an overspent category goes negative. Currency SEK in 2031 is this scenario's own.",
